# hunhar.in Production Environment
# Empty = call the API on the website's own address (/api/... — nginx forwards it to the gateway).
# Works on https://www.hunhar.in and on the server's IP. Set a full URL (https://api.hunhar.in) to use another host.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
VITE_APP_DOMAIN=hunhar.in
VITE_WS_BASE_URL=
